@dsh-external/dsh-calendar-clock README · dsh-plugin-calendar-clock：[](https://github.com/XZT1118/dsh-plugin-calendar-clock/actions/workflows/ci.yml)

A [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) web GUI plugin: a clock button in the sidebar foot, next to Settings. Clicking it opens a card with a live digital clock, an analog dial, and a month calendar.

一个 DeepSeek Harness Web GUI 插件：在**侧边栏底部、设置按钮旁**加一个时钟按钮，点开是实时数字时钟 + 模拟表盘 + 月历。

@dsh-external/dsh-calendar-clock README · Install：Manual equivalent, if you prefer to edit the profile yourself — add both of these to `$DSH_HOME/profiles/<profile>/package.json`, then run `pnpm install` in the profile directory:

```jsonc
{
  "dsh": { "profile": { "bundles": [
    // ... existing bundles, official ones first ...
    "@dsh-external/dsh-calendar-clock"

The bundle list order is the patch-layer order; keep official bundles ahead of third-party ones.
